Bundled terminal compatibility code
----------------------------------
PanCode bundles the JavaScript from the pinned @earendil-works/pi-tui with a
local search/semantic-edit, wrapping and render-memo patch, plus marked,
marked-cjk-friendly and get-east-asian-width.
Their MIT notices are distributed in dist/assets/tui-notices/. The pinned
pi-tui runtime package remains installed for its Darwin and Windows native
helpers; PanCode does not modify consumer dependencies during installation.

PanCode retains its own credential storage, OAuth provider registry and locked
refresh lifecycle. Anthropic, OpenAI Codex and GitHub Copilot OAuth flows
delegate to Pi; the ALCF OAuth integration remains PanCode-owned. Pi's
CredentialStore and Models.getAuth are not used for stored OAuth.

